WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
but it must also be fair and reciprocal.

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:07.560
The challenge with trade is much the same with climate.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.560
The countries that followed the rules,

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.480
all their factories have been plundered.

